+ * At 320 the fields run 39 px off the screen and the sheet scrolls sideways (10 of 11 fields cut); at 360 the right gutter
+ * is 1 px against 16 px on the left. 390 px and wider already fit. One column that may shrink (minmax(0, 1fr)); the
