+/* [MC-18 = M2-08] 12 infinite shimmer animations keep running on /shop (4 on / and on a product page) after every image has
+ * arrived: 7.5 ms of main-thread time per second at rest. Under prefers-reduced-motion the global rule shortens the duration to
+ * .01 ms but leaves the iteration count infinite, so the shimmer restarts continuously: 47 ms of CPU per second on /shop
+ * (verifier 22, analyst 30) against 0.3 with it off. Three sweeps (about 4 s) are enough to read as "loading"; none when the
